  "reply": {
    "text": "The graph is approved. Before I write the script, here's the story I'd tell. Tell me if it's right.\n\n- **Who it's for:** people who use the app, not its developers.\n- **The one thing to remember:** a reset link works once, and only for an hour.\n- **Shape:** problem, how it works, outcome.\n- **Hook:** \"Someone can't remember their password.\"\n\nThe flow runs from the forgotten password, through the account lookup and the one-time link, to a new password and a signed-in user. Should I save this and draft the script, or would you change anything first?",
